    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/f56ccaaa3eac765ea43ffed859170211.poster.avif?t=1734992936\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/f56ccaaa3eac765ea43ffed859170211.webm?t=1734992936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/f56ccaaa3eac765ea43ffed859170211.mp4?t=1734992936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What would you do if your pet cat transformed into an ancient Egyptian god?</h2>In Passage: A Job Interview Simulator, take on the role of a destitute job-seeker, making tough decisions while you manage seeking a career in the hyper-competitive job market. Luckily, you\u2019ve got your pet cat to help with work-life balance! <br><br>Passage includes a branching narrative spanning 8+ hours of gameplay, an original storyline, original character art, an immersive OST, and 5 unique endings!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUMP INTO THE WORLD OF A GRADUATE JOBSEEKER</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/1e1df66c7b43a67dd46b03dc212af12a.poster.avif?t=1734992936\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/1e1df66c7b43a67dd46b03dc212af12a.webm?t=1734992936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/1e1df66c7b43a67dd46b03dc212af12a.mp4?t=1734992936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Passage, you\u2019re a recent college graduate desperately searching for a job. You\u2019re plagued with constant nightmares about rejection - until, one day, your beloved cat comes to your aid! With his help, you\u2019re able to start taking on the dark world of corporate interviews - these days, an interview can be the difference between life and death\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMPRESS YOUR NEWFOUND CAT-GOD</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/6d99c29f424c7175727479eaa109975f.poster.avif?t=1734992936\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/6d99c29f424c7175727479eaa109975f.webm?t=1734992936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/6d99c29f424c7175727479eaa109975f.mp4?t=1734992936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your newfound friend isn\u2019t just useful for advice - they have unique powers to help you out, too! They\u2019ll even stop time for you\u2026 better hope you impress them with your interview technique, though - there are only so many employers in the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER DARK SECRETS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/6089c1346c85e036d93d421dd91c0308.poster.avif?t=1734992936\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/6089c1346c85e036d93d421dd91c0308.webm?t=1734992936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/6089c1346c85e036d93d421dd91c0308.mp4?t=1734992936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The world of corporate interviews can be dark - and many lose hope, but with our help you can succeed! Discover the truth about your prospective employers and your nightmares as you embark on your epic quest for employment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made jointly in Michigan and Washington.</h2>",
